  "basedOn": {
    "repo": "https://github.com/markfulton/ai-employees",
    "note": "Same kit layout as ai-employees (ROLE.md, SCHEDULE.md, routines/<id>/SKILL.md, runlog.jsonl). The marketing roles are custom kits written for this assignment. Upstream ships GTM Engineer, SEO/AEO, Social Media, Ad Manager and Chief of Staff kits, which these roles are modelled on."
